scaleplex: merge overlay_sub_vaapi HW VAAPI branch into vf_inlineass

Folds the former standalone overlay_sub_vaapi filter (patches 0112/0113)
into vf_inlineass as a format-adaptive HW branch. One Plex-native
`inlineass` node now serves both the GPU fast path (single-input VAAPI
VPP composite, render-once-per-cue, text + PGS/DVD bitmap, render-res cap,
animated tier-down) and the CPU fallback (original FFDraw blend), chosen
from the negotiated input frame format. Drops 0112 (standalone filter) +
0113 (fftools dual-dispatch); the fftools binding keeps a single inlineass
target and routes bitmap codecs to avfilter_inlineass_replay_bitmap.

Requires vaapi + VAProcPipelineCaps_blend_flags; links vaapi_vpp.o.

