+     * VPP upscale the small overlay surface to the full frame during
+     * composite. libass cost ~ (render_h/in_h)^2 → 1080 on 4K is ~4x cheaper.
+     * render_w is kept proportional so the VPP upscale is uniform. Folds in
+     * the old SCALEPLEX_SUB_RENDER_HEIGHT knob. render_height<=0 or >= input
+     * height → no cap (full-res render). */
+    {
